["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">差</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>差异；差距；插入；撑（伞）；照射</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さ.す・さ.し</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">差す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">照射；闪耀；显现；露出；泛着；染上；上涨；流入；油然而生；涌上心头；撑起；举起；（舞蹈）向前伸直手臂；插入；置入；佩刀于腰间；挟于腋下携带；（相扑）将手臂插入对方腋下；撑船；撑篙；倾注；添加；斟（酒）；涂抹；上色；染色；点燃；烧起；关闭；锁上；栓好；中断；搁置</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">交差点</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうさてん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">十字路口；交叉口</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">差し上げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さしあげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">抬起；举起；提起；赠送；奉献；呈上；为（某人）做</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">末</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>末尾；末端；粉末；子孙；结束</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">マツ・バツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すえ・うら・うれ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">末</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うら</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顶端；尖端</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">粗末</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そまつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">粗糙；粗陋；朴素；简陋；破旧；劣质；低劣</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">月末</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">げつまつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">月末；月终</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">守</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\