</a>推测；察觉；理解；观察；检查</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">サツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">警察</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">警察；警官；警察人员；警察局；派出所；（接名词后）自封的规则纠察者；爱管闲事的人；民间执法者；把关人</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">観察</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">观察；调查；监视</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">診察</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんさつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">医学检查；体检；就诊</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">段</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>阶段；台阶；楼梯；等级；段落</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ダン・タン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">階段</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">阶梯；楼梯</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">段</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">だん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">台阶；梯级；梯档；架子；层；层级；等级；级别；档次；段位；段（武术、围棋、将棋等的级别）；段落；段；栏；列；幕；场；折；乘法表的一行；阶段；步骤；时期；时刻；场景；事项；场合；程度；幅度；（量词）段（用于文章或话语的分段）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">手段</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">手段；方式；办法</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">横</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>横向；侧面；宽度；横（无理）；横（歪斜）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よこ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横向；水平；左右；宽度；广度；侧面；边；旁边；身旁；近处；无关；不相干</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横断</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうだん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横穿；穿过；横贯；相交；横断；横越；横渡；飞越；航越；横截；横切；横向切断</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">横切る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よこぎる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">横切；横穿；穿过</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">深</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>深；加深；变深；深度</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ふか.い・-ぶか.い・ふか.まる・ふか.める・み-</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深い</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ふかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">深；深刻；深远；浓密；厚重；亲密；密切；强烈；浓厚；深；晚</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深刻</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんこく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">严重；严肃</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">深夜</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しんや</span><span class=\"k-wz\">深夜；午夜</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">申</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>申述；申（地支第九位）；申时（下午3-5点）；猴（生肖第九位）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">もう.す・もう.し-・さる</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">说；称为；做；进行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し上げる</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしあげる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">说；告诉；陈述；表达；献（祝贺等）；做</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">申し訳</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">もうしわけ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">道歉；借口；托词</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">様</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>样子；方式；状态；类似；敬称（接人名后）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ヨウ・ショウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">さま・さん</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">先生；太太；小姐；女士；使词语更加礼貌（常用于固定表达）；状态；情形；外观；样子</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">王様</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">おうさま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">王；国王</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">様々</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さまざま</span><span class=\"k-wz\">各种各样；五花八门；形形色色</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">財</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>财产；财富；金钱；资产</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ザイ・サイ・ゾク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">たから</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">財布</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">さいふ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">钱包；皮夹；零钱包</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">財産</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざいさん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">财产；财富；资产</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">財</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ざい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">财富；财产；货物；商品；财团法人</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">港</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>港口；港湾</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">みなと</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">港</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">みなと</span><span class=\"k-wz\">港口；海港；港湾</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">空港</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">くうこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">机场</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">識</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>识别；知道；书写</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">シキ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">し.る・しる.す</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">意識</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">意识；知觉状态；意识到；察觉；感知；意识（佛教用语，六识之一，指对感觉信息进行认知的心识）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">常識</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">常识；理性；常规；通识；社交礼仪</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">知識</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちしき</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知识；学识</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">呼</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>呼叫；呼吸；邀请；召唤；称呼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.ぶ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼ぶ</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よぶ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">呼叫；呼唤；唤起；召唤（医生等）；邀请；称为；命名；称呼；博得（支持等）；聚集；娶为妻子；迎娶</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼吸</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こきゅう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">呼吸；呼吸作用；窍门；诀窍；秘诀；和谐；协调；同步；配合；短暂间隔；短暂停顿</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">呼び出す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">よびだす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">叫来；传唤；召唤；打电话叫；呼叫（如呼叫服务）；唤起（如唤起精灵）；调用；打开；启动</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">達</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>达到；到达；完成；达成</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">タツ・ダ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">-たち</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">友達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ともだち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">朋友</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">上達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">进步；提高；进展；上达；下情上达</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">配達</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はいたつ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">配送；递送；投递</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">良</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>良好；擅长；令人满意</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">よ.い・-よ.い・い.い・-い.い</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仲良し</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なかよし</span><span class=\"k-wz\">亲密的友谊；亲密的朋友；好友；知心伙伴；老友；亲密关系；性交；做爱</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">改良</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かいりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">改良；改进；改革</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">善良</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ぜんりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">善良；心地好；有德行；诚实</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">候</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>气候；季节；天气；等待；期望</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">コウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そうろう</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">気候</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">きこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">气候</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">候補</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうほ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">候选人；竞争者；候选项；选项；名单；候选资格；候选人身份；提名</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">天候</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">てんこう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">天气；天候</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">程</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/kanji/\">N3</a>程度；限度；距离；规定；量</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほど・-ほど</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">程度</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ていど</span><span class=\"k-wz\">程度；等级；标准；大约；左右</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">課程</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">课程；课程体系</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">過程</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かてい</span><span class=\"k-wz\